--TEST--
a field name in a compiler attribute's payload is offered the fields its card lists, here `#[Core\Api]`'s reached through a `use`d short name, `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Core\Api;

class Orders
{
    #[Core\Route(path: "/orders", method: Core\Http\Method::Get)]
    #[Core\Access(allow: Core\Audience::Public)]
    #[Api(tags: ["Orders"], sec<|>)]
    public function index(): string
    {
        return "";
    }
}
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
errors  field     array<{status: int, type: string}> (optional)
example field     object (optional)
operationId field     string (optional)
security field     array<string> (optional)
tags    field     array<string> (optional)
